    "created_at": "2017-06-22T17:38:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-06-22T17:38:57Z",
    "body": "The new dev edition is live!! https://html.spec.whatwg.org/dev/\r\n\r\nIt definitely needs help adding w-nodev as appropriate. We did some of that in https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/28b739e2d4b1a5b71d0a90c1dad7ff1a99bd7288, but we really need to go through section-by-section. @momdo or anyone else, any help would be appreciated. Let us know if there are specific sections you are working on so we can avoid duplicating work.\r\n\r\nI will work on a document with guidelines as to what to be included or not.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
