    "created_at": "2017-06-28T00:23:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-06-28T00:23:40Z",
    "body": "The guidelines are now available at https://github.com/whatwg/html/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#the-developers-edition. We've also published a blog post about the new developer's edition: https://blog.whatwg.org/developers-edition-comeback\r\n\r\nIf someone wants to help, here is a very simple starter project: exclude the entire \"IANA considerations\" section from the output, as it is not developer-relevant. This will just consist of finding the appropriate place in the source to add `<div w-nodev>` and `</div>` to encompass all of that.",
